<Text color="#94A3B8FF" fontSize="12.0" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" text="本页扣缴比例为我自拟的演示设定，各地社保与公积金" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="738" top="890" width="428" height="17.04">
<Text color="#94A3B8FF" fontSize="12.0" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" text="比例、缴费基数上下限各省市不同，我未引用任何具体城市。" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="52" top="950" width="1136" height="706">
<Container color="#FFFFFFFF" borderRadius="18.0" border="1 SOLID #E2E8F0FF" boxShadow="0 4 18 0 #0F172A0E" width="1136" height="706" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="76" top="968" width="472.0" height="28.4">
<Text color="#0B1220FF" fontSize="20.0" fontFamily="Inter Semi Bold,Noto Sans CJK SC" text="加薪到手曲线：涨 3,000 元，到手只有 2,115 元" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="76" top="996" width="598.14" height="18.46">
<Text color="#94A3B8FF" fontSize="13.0" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" text="横轴 = 月薪；绿线 = 到手金额；红线 = 到手比例。比例线不是直线，它在税率档的边界上折了下去。" />
</Positioned>
