<Positioned left="94.0" top="1382" width="317.33" height="21.3">
<Text color="#0B1220FF" fontSize="15.0" fontFamily="Inter Semi Bold,Noto Sans CJK SC" text="加薪的边际到手会往下走" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="94.0" top="1408" width="253.12" height="17.04">
<Text color="#126436FF" fontSize="12.0" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" text="涨  3,000元，到手  +2,115元（70.5%）" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="94.0" top="1446" width="232.0" height="17.04">
<Text color="#475569FF" fontSize="12.0" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" text="谈判时先算到手，不要拿应发数字比较。" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="443.33" top="1370" width="353.33" height="122">
<Container color="#F8FAFCFF" borderRadius="12.0" width="353.33" height="122" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="443.33" top="1370" width="4" height="122">
<Container color="#BE123C" borderRadius="2.0" width="4" height="122" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="461.33" top="1382" width="317.33" height="21.3">
<Text color="#0B1220FF" fontSize="15.0" fontFamily="Inter Semi Bold,Noto Sans CJK SC" text="比例的折点由税率档决定" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="461.33" top="1408" width="309.76" height="17.04">
<Text color="#911235FF" fontSize="12.0" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" text="应纳税所得额越过  36,000元后，边际税率从  3%跳到" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="461.33" top="1425" width="39.76" height="17.04">
<Text color="#911235FF" fontSize="12.0" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" text="10%" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="461.33" top="1446" width="270.64" height="17.04">
<Text color="#475569FF" fontSize="12.0" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" text="折点是可以算出来的：把年薪减  144,000元。" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="810.67" top="1370" width="353.33" height="122">
<Container color="#F8FAFCFF" borderRadius="12.0" width="353.33" height="122" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="810.67" top="1370" width="4" height="122">
<Container color="#0F766E" borderRadius="2.0" width="4" height="122" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="828.67" top="1382" width="317.33" height="21.3">
<Text color="#0B1220FF" fontSize="15.0" fontFamily="Inter Semi Bold,Noto Sans CJK SC" text="专项附加扣除是最值的杠杆" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="828.67" top="1408" width="321.28" height="17.04">
<Text color="#0E5D5AFF" fontSize="12.0" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" text=" 7,000元/月   =84,000元/年，直接压低应纳税所得额" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="828.67" top="1446" width="208.0" height="17.04">
<Text color="#475569FF" fontSize="12.0" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" text="漏填一项，实际交的钱就白多出去。" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="76" top="1508" width="1088" height="128">
<Container color="#E8F2ECFF" borderRadius="14.0" border="1 SOLID #15803D66" width="1088" height="128" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="96" top="1520" width="212.0" height="19.88">
<Text color="#104E30FF" fontSize="14.0" fontFamily="Inter Semi Bold,Noto Sans CJK SC" text="下次谈薪，把这三句话放在桌上" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="96" top="1546" width="1048" height="21.3">
<Text color="#0B1220FF" fontSize="15.0" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" text="① 先报应发，再当场算到手：应发涨 3,000、到手涨 2,115，这个比例不是我编的，是把你的专项附加扣除填满之后的算法。" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="96" top="1574" width="1048" height="21.3">
<Text color="#0B1220FF" fontSize="15.0" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" text="② 知道折点在哪儿：全年应纳税所得额越过 36,000 元，税率从 3% 跳 10%；越过 144,000 元再跳 20%。要避开折点，就把收入拆成年终奖与工资。" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="96" top="1602" width="1048" height="21.3">
<Text color="#0B1220FF" fontSize="15.0" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" text="③ 先把该填的填完：子女教育 2,000、赡养老人 3,000，合计 5,000 元/月。漏填的代价直接体现在每月到手数上。" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="52" top="1688" width="1136" height="17.04">
<Text color="#94A3B8FF" fontSize="12.0" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" text="综合所得减除费用 60000 元/年（个人所得税法第六条）；税率表 3%(0) / 10%(2520) / 20%(16920) / 25%(31920) / 30%(52920) / 35%(85920) / 45%(181920)" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="52" top="1706" width="1136" height="17.04">
<Text color="#94A3B8FF" fontSize="12.0" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" text="取自国家税务总局个人所得税税率表（fgk.chinatax.gov.cn）与《中华人民共和国个人所得税法》第六条（fgk.chinatax.gov.cn）。" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="52" top="1724" width="1136" height="17.04">
<Text color="#94A3B8FF" fontSize="12.0" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" text="专项附加扣除标准：国发〔2023〕13号《国务院关于提高个人所得税有关专项附加扣除标准的通知》（fgk.chinatax.gov.cn）：婴幼儿照护 2000、子女教育 2000、赡养老人 3000 元/月。" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="52" top="1742" width="1136" height="17.04">
<Text color="#94A3B8FF" fontSize="12.0" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" text="「小陈」为虚构人物；月薪 25,000 元、缴费基数 18,800 元与养老 8% / 医疗 2% / 失业 0.5% / 公积金 12% 的比例为我自拟的演示设定，各地社保比例与基数上下限各省市不同，本页不引用任何具体城市。" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="52" top="1760" width="1136" height="17.04">
